4a:15:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Niddah_24a.15.2"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"raw":"אם הוא בן אשי הקדמון אשר ר' חייא אחיו היה תלמיד רב א\"כ האריך ימים","reason":"The Ashi entry calls Hiyya the earlier Ashi’s son, so Hiyya would be Shimi’s brother under this hypothesis. The identification is conditional.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 642:1","target":{"entry":642,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"raw":"ור' שמואל מתווך","reason":"The detached name and the parsing of מתווך remain open; the nearby folio does not determine their meaning.","evidence":[{"reference":"Yoma 62a:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yoma_62a.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"ובש\"ס חדשים לא תקנו","reason":"The checked Bavli retains bar Abaye. The identity of Heilprin’s new editions remains uncollated.","evidence":[{"reference":"Ketubot 60a:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_60a.1"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rif Ketubot 24b:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rif_Ketubot_24b.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Rosh on Ketubot 5:17:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rosh_on_Ketubot_5.17.2"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"raw":"לא ידעתי איזה שימי","reason":"Heilprin’s stated uncertainty remains intact.","evidence":[{"reference":"Zevachim 71b:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zevachim_71b.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The explicit Rav Pappa narrative, two historical treatment reports, Abaye stories, Kahana chains and the Ashi/Abaye witnesses are checked. The two escort reports have different pairs of participants. The earlier-Ashi inference, detached Shmuel phrase, Tosafot attribution, and bare-Shimi identification remain qualified.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Taanit 9b:2","target":{"url":"https://ww